{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25793","headline":"初秋忽奉诏除浙东观察使检校右貂 · 李绅","name":"初秋忽奉诏除浙东观察使检校右貂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙楼寄引簪裾客，凤阙陪趋朔望朝。\n疎受杜门期脱屣，买臣归邸忽乘轺。\n印封龟纽知颁爵，冠饰蝉緌更珥貂。\n飞诏宠荣欢里舍，岂徒斑白与垂髫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25793.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25793","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}